{"version":1,"content":"<p>本周蘋果向iPhone Duo推送了iOS 27.3 Beta 2開發者固件，新增了一項基於前置攝像頭的人臉解鎖功能。雖然iPhone Duo並沒有配備Face ID所需的TrueDepth硬件，但用户現在也可以通過外屏攝像頭識別人臉，快速解鎖手機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587044.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.863658+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:14:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"95d3f52bdda46c2bf0471b1577e004396d216a825da886c21c84ed8a015b01ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}